WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:08.840
One of the things that's been helpful with AI is finding documentation or

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:14.800
explanations of code for BoTorch, which is very underdeveloped and doesn't

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.300
have a lot of documentation for it.

00:00:16.527 --> 00:00:20.087
for the powder doser it's been Claude has been controlling the whole thing

00:00:19.787 --> 00:00:23.100
writing the code that does the tests and running the tests

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:27.500
The scary part of that is I have not done that and I don't currently know

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.390
like if you asked me to do it myself I couldn't do it right now it would

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:32.700
take me a couple days probably that's scary

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.200
The human element is important in research especially when you're putting

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:40.167
your name on it if Claude is doing research then anybody can push the button

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.140
If I'm doing research it should have aspects of me in it should have that

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:48.260
human element that it's specific to me and my ideas and my work
